// ------------------------------------------------------------------ routing
// The default order is not fixed: each search ranks the usable providers by measured
// quality for the kind of query (intent), times a budget "pace" factor that slides a
// metered provider down once it is ahead of its free allowance for the period. So the
// best provider goes first while it can afford to, and the unmetered ones absorb the
// rest. DEFAULT_ORDER above is only the tie-breaker (and the order under --static).
//
// Free allowance per provider, from each provider's own pricing/docs page (2026-09-28).
// period: 'month' (resets monthly), 'once' (one-time credit, paced over a year), or
// null (unmetered — rate-limited but no quota).
